\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {12}{\ignorespaces \texttt  {WP0039} final 3\,s. Top: both channels drop out together and alternate 1.4--3.2\,A reconnect spikes at 34\,Hz. Bottom: the sag floor ratchets monotonically from 13.9\,V to 7.6\,V, then the bus free-falls and the log truncates mid-decay (no trailer) --- consistent with an MCU brownout. \texttt  {fault\_flags} remained zero throughout.}}{16}{figure.caption.17}\protected@file@percent }
