\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {19}{\ignorespaces The fuel-cell source knee. \texttt  {WP0100} (green) and \texttt  {WP0099} (red) run the same $b=0.15$ profile; their solo-episode fuel-cell currents differ by $\approx $0.1\,A. \texttt  {WP0100} holds 7.8\,V through 28 episodes; \texttt  {WP0099}'s rail collapses on its fifth episode and the input current runs away.}}{27}{figure.caption.32}\protected@file@percent }
